<title>CHINA: Shanghai Narcissus net down 65 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Narcissus net down 65 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated)</p>
<p> Turnover	415.41	   vs     495.621</p>
<p> Net profit	7.717	  vs	21.862</p>
<p> Earnings per share    0.033 yuan  (no comparative figure)</p>
<p> Net assets per share  2.16 yuan   (no comparative figure)</p>
<p>Note: the figures were unaudited. Shanghai Narcissus</p>
<p>Electric Appliances Industry co ltd is a</p>
<p>major manufacturer of household washing machines.</p>
</text>
